                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "DeathMetal is a steampunk Break Out-clone with a some unique ideas when it comes to geometry.\nAs a fan of both Break Out-games and Death Metal, it caught my attention in the store. It didn't deliver on either of them.\nIt has ONE Slayer-esque track and some lackluster powerups.\nThe concept still intrigues me, and I hope the dev keeps working on it, but \"as is\" it's quite emaciated.\nThere is very little variety and it has more flash than contents.\n\nLook at what DX-Ball did 20 years ago.",
